72 135 :M
-.116(energy-path semiclassical ground-state \(MEPSAG\) method, the centrifugal-dominant)A
72 159 :M
-.123(small-curvature semiclassical adiabatic ground-state \(CD-SCSAG\) method, the large)A
72 183 :M
-.087(curvature ground-state version-3 \(LCG3\) method, the least-action ground-state \(LAG\))A
72 206 :M
-.139(method, and the microcanonical optimized multidimensional tunneling \()A
f1_12 sf
