2.882 .288(LONG WRITE-UP)J
72 87 :M
2.765 .276(1.  Introduction)J
108 111 :M
f0_10 sf
-.188(ABCRATE)A
f0_12 sf
-.14( is a computer program for the calculation of atom-diatom bimolecular)A
72 135 :M
-.139(gas-phase chemical reaction rates with collinear-dominated reaction paths.  The reaction)A
72 159 :M
-.119(rates are determined using conventional [1-4] and variational transition state theory [3-11])A
72 183 :M
-.07(with multidimensional semiclassical tunneling coefficients [5,7,10,12-18].  These methods)A
72 207 :M
-.14(provide a conceptual framework for the interpretation of chemical reaction rates for atom-)A
72 231 :M
-.082(diatom as well as polyatomic systems.)A
108 255 :M
-.121(Variational transition state theory \(VTST\) is a reaction-path method.  It is based on)A
72 279 :M
-.091(separating the motions of the system along a reaction path from those transverse to it.  In)A
72 303 :M
-.133(the present computer program the reaction path must be collinear, and it may be either the)A
72 327 :M
-.099(minimum-energy path, when that is collinear, or the lowest-energy collinear reaction path.)A
72 351 :M
-.108(To emphasize this generality in certain parts of the discussion, we call this path the)A
72 375 :M
-.117(reference path.  The present program involves uncoupled treatment of the vibrational and)A
72 399 :M
-.119(rotational modes.  Anharmonicity has proved to be an important consideration in VTST)A
72 423 :M
-.109(calculations, and several methods have been developed for the inclusion of anharmonic)A
72 447 :M
-.083(effects [5,19-22].  Tunneling effects have also proven to be an important factor in the)A
72 471 :M
-.114(determination of accurate reaction rates, especially for systems in which the transferring)A
72 495 :M
-.107(atom is a light atom such as hydrogen, leading to the development of one-dimensional)A
72 519 :M
-.006([2,5,12,23] as well as multidimensional [5,7,10,12-18,22] methods for the determination)A
72 543 :M
-.093(of semiclassical transmission coefficients.)A
108 567 :M
-.154(The application of variational transition state theory with multidimensional)A
72 591 :M
-.125(semiclassical tunneling coefficients to atom-diatom reactions has been successful in tests)A
72 615 :M
-.126(against experimental results, with the success limited more by the accuracy of the potential)A
72 639 :M
-.096(energy surface than by the accuracy of the dynamics.  This is well confirmed for atom-)A
72 663 :M
-.153(diatom systems by calculations that could be tested against accurate quantum mechanical)A
72 687 :M
.084 .008(dynamics calculations for one [8,9,11,13,21,24] and three dimensions [11,22,25-30] for)J
endp
